CELL gauge rises little by little. When the gauge is maxed out, call on a new CELL.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >2.The carrier comes out of the base</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2553790/extras/5e4893b661a4868ca2d60520fdc14554.poster.avif?t=1771496619\" width=620 height=182 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2553790/extras/5e4893b661a4868ca2d60520fdc14554.webm?t=1771496619\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2553790/extras/5e4893b661a4868ca2d60520fdc14554.mp4?t=1771496619\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>The item carrier comes to you with a countdown. Wait for it to reach you.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >3.Carrier's arrival&amp;Support attack activated!</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2553790/extras/64e72899582891db05669eed7e5692b6.poster.avif?t=1771496619\" width=620 height=182 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2553790/extras/64e72899582891db05669eed7e5692b6.webm?t=1771496619\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2553790/extras/64e72899582891db05669eed7e5692b6.mp4?t=1771496619\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>As soon as the carrier arrives, it covers you with fire attacks. You're invincible so go catch the item you requested!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >4.Replace your CELL with the new one and fight!</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2553790/extras/b43996796d60fcf0d7d74bd0e0777992.poster.avif?t=1771496619\" width=620 height=182 ><source src=